The sites for resource production
HOUSING:
A house shelter from 2 to 20 civilians paying taxes therefore increasing your finances. It is important to protect your houses because civilian casualties will result in negative points.
SMELTING FURNACE:
It provides the metal production from the ore collected by trucks at the mine. More the smelting furnace is close to the mine more the production is intensive.
REFINERY:
For fuel production, they can be built only on coasts, tankers are required for shuttle to the nearest oil platform. It is essential to maintain high fuel stocks in order to prevent units from running out of fuel.
Units production facilities
FACTORY:
For ground units production either civilian vehicles and armours. It is also the right place to repair damaged vehicles.
AIRFIELD:
It is used for aircraft production and also provides a tarmac for them to takeoff. Aircraft automatically go on repair when they have been damaged.
SHIPYARD:
To be built only on coast, it produce and repair all navy units. A powerful fleet is the key to fast conquest.
Select units
Open a selection zone by dragging the mouse while keeping the left button clicked.
Cancel the selection
Select a group from 0 to 9 directly from the keyboard
Create a group with the CTRL key and the number of the group
Dismiss a group with ALT key and the group number
Use the SHIFT key to add or suppress a unit from the selected group
Change the orientation of group formation with the CTRL key
